  data: {
    LLM: "Mark penalty tiles; moon shots more frequent than in Hearts. Use double-0: lead as blank to win trick, or as double to dump it if another double is out.\n\nLead low blanks to force 0-0 onto others; beware helping a moon-shot. When passing, passing high/penalty tiles left helps neighbour's moon-shot—sometimes keep them.\n\nHolding doubles and penalty tiles can defend against moon-shots. Penalty tiles can fall to other suits; hard to defend. Same family as 11 Point and 30 Point Black Tile.",
    Player: "Mark penalty tiles; moon shots more frequent than in Hearts. Use double-0: lead as blank to win trick, or as double to dump it if another double is out.\n\nLead low blanks to force 0-0 onto others; beware helping a moon-shot. When passing, passing high/penalty tiles left helps neighbour's moon-shot—sometimes keep them.\n\nHolding doubles and penalty tiles can defend against moon-shots. Penalty tiles can fall to other suits; hard to defend. Same family as 11 Point and 30 Point Black Tile.",
